          "short": "$-20$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-2-3\\times(-1+7)&=-2-3\\times6\\\\&=-2-18\\\\&=-20\\end{align*}$$\nCalculator check: $-20$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
