        "answer": {
          "short": "$8$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(-3+(-5))\\times(-2-(-1))&=(-8)\\times(-2-(-1))\\\\&=(-8)\\times(-2+1)\\\\&=(-8)\\times(-1)\\\\&=8\\end{align*}$$\nCalculator check: $8$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
