        "answer": {
          "short": "$-6$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-3\\div(-1+4)\\times6&=-3\\div3\\times6\\\\&=-1\\times6\\\\&=-6\\end{align*}$$\nDivision and multiplication are evaluated from left to right. Calculator check: $-6$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 25
      },
      {
        "id": "p55-q7-l",
